{"2310390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Anomaly Manor", "steam_appid": 2310390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Anomaly Manor</strong> is a cooperative horror anomaly game for 1–6 players, set in a cursed manor deep within the woods. Your objective: Find every anomaly to bring an end to a dark ritual — but here, surviving 8 correct decisions in a row is not the end, only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the manor carefully, pay attention to the smallest differences, and decide at the ritual table whether something has changed. After every decision, the house shifts once again: objects throughout the rooms change, anomalies appear, and deadly creatures begin hunting you — or nothing changes at all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ anomalies</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ loops</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 unlockable rooms</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online co-op</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310390/extras/8a257295cfd4154c894c3697a4dc3c5c.poster.avif?t=1780087807\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310390/extras/8a257295cfd4154c894c3697a4dc3c5c.webm?t=1780087807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2310390/extras/8a257295cfd4154c894c3697a4dc3c5c.mp4?t=1780087807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p 